WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:02.920
- Let's descend into the
mouth of Hell, shall we?

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.005
(sinister music)

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.802
- [Nun] These sessions are
mandatory for all staff,

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:11.637
Sister Ann.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:15.432
- My mother struggled
with depression.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:16.308
(knocking)

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:19.561
- [Mom] Annie.
Annie, honey, can I come in?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.104
- [Ann] But, even as a child,

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:21.939
I knew it was...

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:24.066
- [Mom] Annie open the door,
please.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:25.525
- More.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:26.902
(door knob rattling)
- [Mom] Let me in, Annie!

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:28.862
Let me in, Annie!

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.240
- [Ann] My mother talked about
hearing that voice inside.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.243
- [Mom] Let me in, Annie!
Let me in!

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:35.327
(girl screams)

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:38.330
- [Ann] She said the voice
didn't really want her.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.545
- [Priest] The Citadel has
fallen.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.881
Black smoke blots out the sun.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.050
Because as some of you may
already know,

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.386
we have a female student
in the class.

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:53.720
Only as an observer.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.848
So, let's descend into the
mouth of Hell, shall we?

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:01.603
There are more possessions
reported today,

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:04.064
than at any other time
in history.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.066
So, we must fight for
every soul.

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:10.654
- [Priest 2] Defend us in battle

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:13.323
against the spirits of
wickedness.

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:15.158
(bones crunching)

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.078
(girl snarls)

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:23.709
- [Natalie] Let me in!

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:29.256
- [Ann] I believe the demon
that is tormenting Natalie,

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:31.300
and the demon
that possessed my mother

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.384
are one and the same.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:36.263
- [Priest] I'd like to teach
Sister Ann,

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:38.140
just enough to protect herself

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:38.974
and others.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.563
This relationship she had,

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:47.899
it's personal.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.777
- We've been waiting for you.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:54.823
(ethereal singing)

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:56.992
Your mother has a pretty voice.

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:00.329
(door slams)

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:01.830
- [Ann] Hello?

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:04.624
- Let

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:05.751
me

00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:07.127
in!

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.505
- [Priest] Be careful.

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:11.673
Once you know the devil,

00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:13.633
- [Whispered Voice] Annie.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.885
- [Priest] the devil knows you.

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.139
(Ann screams)

00:02:22.309 --> 00:02:24.519
(strained gasping)

00:02:26.772 --> 00:02:29.691
(ethereal singing)

